         <div class="hero hero--has-image">
            <div class="container">
               <h1>WCJC Athletics</h1><picture><img src="/images/student-life/Student_Life-Athletics-Hero_Image.jpg" alt="Banner Image"></picture></div>
         </div>
         <div class="container container--narrow">
            <div class="container__top">
               <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumbs"><a class="breadcrumbs__item" href="https://www.wcjc.edu/">Home</a><a class="breadcrumbs__item" href="https://www.wcjc.edu/student-life/">Student Life</a><span class="breadcrumbs__item-current">Athletics</span></nav>
            </div>
            <div class="aside aside--desktop"><div class="section-nav"><nav role="navigation" aria-label="Section"><button class="section-nav__bttn" aria-expanded="false"><span>Current Page</span><span class="section-nav__bttn-icon"></span></button><ul class="section-nav__dropdown"><li><a href="/student-life/athletics/default.aspx" aria-current="page">In This Section</a><ul><li><a href="/student-life/athletics/baseball/default.aspx">Pioneer Baseball</a></li><li><a href="/student-life/athletics/rodeo/default.aspx">Pioneer Rodeo</a></li><li><a href="/student-life/athletics/volleyball/default.aspx">Pioneer Volleyball</a></li><li><a href="/student-life/fitness-center.aspx">Ty Pate Fitness Center</a></li><li><a href="/student-life/athletics/Athletic_Staff.aspx">Athletic Staff </a></li></ul></nav></div></div>
            <div class="container__main container__main--wide">
               <section class="page-intro">
                  <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Welcome to WCJC Pioneer Athletics! Our athletics department includes Baseball, Rodeo,
                        and Volleyball! The Pioneers are members of the National Junior College Athletic Association
                        and the National Intercollegiate Rodeo Association.&nbsp;</span></p>
                  
                  <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">With a winning combination of teamwork, determination, and heart, our teams are ready
                        to hit the court, field, and arena. We look forward to seeing you at our games, matches,
                        and rodeos!</span></p>
               </section>
               <div class="narrow-box-wrapper">
                  <section class="wysiwyg"></section>
               </div>
               <section class="section gen3col">
                  <div class="section__header gen3col__header">
                     <h2>WCJC Pioneer Athletics</h2>
                  </div>
                  <div class="section__intro gen3col__intro">Create your legacy. Make friends for life. Create memories that you’ll never forget
                     with WCJC Pioneer Athletics! </div>
                  <div class="column column--three">
                     
                     <div class="column__col">
                        
                        <div class="column__img">
                           <img alt="Placeholder image" src="/images/student-life/Student_Life-Athletics-Photo_of_Baseball_Team_In_Action.jpg">
                           </div>
                        
                        <div class="column__title">
                           
                           <h3>
                              <a target="_self" href="/student-life/athletics/baseball/default.aspx">Baseball</a>
                              </h3>
                           		  
                           </div>
                        
                        <div class="column__subtitle">
                           Men’s
                           </div>
                        
                        <div class="column__body">
                           <span style="font-weight: 400;">WCJC's Pioneer Baseball Team hits it out of the park! Join us for nine innings of
                              America’s favorite pastime!</span>
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     
                     
                     <div class="column__col">
                        
                        <div class="column__img">
                           <img alt="Placeholder image" src="/images/student-life/Rodeo_images/Sonnier27-9-80s.jpg">
                           </div>
                        
                        <div class="column__title">
                           
                           <h3>
                              <a target="_self" href="/student-life/athletics/rodeo/default.aspx">Rodeo</a>
                              </h3>
                           		  
                           </div>
                        
                        <div class="column__subtitle">
                           Co-Ed
                           </div>
                        
                        <div class="column__body">
                           <span style="font-weight: 400;">WCJC's Pioneer Cowboys and Cowgirls are some of the toughest in the arena! Come support
                              the Pioneer Rodeo Team all year long!</span>
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     
                     
                     <div class="column__col">
                        
                        <div class="column__img">
                           <img alt="Placeholder image" src="/images/student-life/BCS-9744-volleyball-action-shot-Game-Sept-19.jpg">
                           </div>
                        
                        <div class="column__title">
                           
                           <h3>
                              <a target="_self" href="/student-life/athletics/volleyball/default.aspx">Volleyball</a>
                              </h3>
                           		  
                           </div>
                        
                        <div class="column__subtitle">
                           Women’s
                           </div>
                        
                        <div class="column__body">
                           <span style="font-weight: 400;">The WCJC Volleyball Team is a force to be reckoned with! Join us for a match in the
                              Gene Bahnsen Gymnasium on the Wharton Campus!</span>
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     </div>
               </section>
               
               
               	
               <section class="section story-display">
                  		
                  <div class="section__header story-display__header">
                     			
                     <h2>Once a Pioneer, Always a Pioneer</h2>
                     		</div>
                  		
                  <div class="section__intro story-display__intro">
                     			When you are a part of WCJC Athletics, you have a family for life. WCJC is not
                     only a great place to study, but it’s a great place to keep up with your passion and
                     achieve your athletic goals.
                     		</div>
                  		
                  <div class="story-display__wrap">
                     			
                     <div class="story-display__content">
                        				
                        <div class="story-display__quote">
                           					Attending WCJC was by far the best educational and athletic decision I could
                           have made. The WCJC experience helped me grow up.
                           				</div>
                        				
                        				
                        <div class="story-display__title">
                           					Will Parker
                           				</div>
                        				
                        <div class="story-display__subtitle">
                           					Class of 1968; Former Pioneer Football Player
                           				</div>
                        				
                        <div class="story-display__caption">
                           					<span style="font-weight: 400;">Mr. Parker was named to the WCJC Athletic Hall of Fame in 2021. He never forgot his
                              time on the field or in the classroom at WCJC.</span>
                           				</div>
                        			</div>
                     			
                     <div class="story-display__img">
                        				<img alt="Will Parker" src="/images/student-life/Parker-Will.jpg">
                        			</div>
                     		</div>
                  	</section>
                
               
               
               	
               <section class="section carousel">
                  		
                  <div class="section__header carousel__header">
                     			
                     <h2>We are the Pioneers!</h2>
                     		</div>
                  		
                  		
                  <div class="carousel__wrapper">
                     			
                     <div class="carousel__item">
                        	
                        <div class="carousel__image">
                           		<img src="/images/student-life/Student_Life-Athletics-SLIDE_1.jpg" alt="Woman volleyball team">
                           	</div>
                        	
                        <div class="carousel__caption">
                           		<span style="font-weight: 400;">Huddle up and cheer on your WCJC Pioneer Volleyball Team!</span>
                           	</div>
                        </div>
                     <div class="carousel__item">
                        	
                        <div class="carousel__image">
                           		<img src="/images/student-life/Student_Life-Athletics-SLIDE_2.jpg" alt="Baseball player">
                           	</div>
                        	
                        <div class="carousel__caption">
                           		<span style="font-weight: 400;">Meet us at Corbett Park for a baseball game!</span>
                           	</div>
                        </div>
                     <div class="carousel__item">
                        	
                        <div class="carousel__image">
                           		<img src="/images/student-life/Student_Life-Athletics-SLIDE_3.jpg" alt="Rodeo team">
                           	</div>
                        	
                        <div class="carousel__caption">
                           		<span style="font-weight: 400;">Join us for an adrenaline-packed day in the arena!</span>
                           	</div>
                        </div>
                     		</div>
                  	</section>
                
               
               
               	
               <section class="admissions-resources">
                  		
                  <div class="admissions-resources__header">
                     			
                     <h2 class="admissions-resources__title">Equity in Athletics</h2>
                     			
                     		</div>
                  		
                  <div class="admissions-resources__box">
                     			
                     <div class="admissions-resources__content">
                        				
                        <div class="admissions-resources__info">
                           					
                           <h3 class="admissions-resources__subtitle">WCJC EADA Reports</h3>
                           					
                           <div class="admissions-resources__body">
                              						The Equity in Athletics Disclosure Act (EADA) is designed to make prospective
                              students aware of a college's commitment to providing equitable athletic opportunities
                              for its men and women students.
                              					</div>
                           				</div>
                        				
                        <div class="admissions-resources__links">
                           
                           					
                           <div class="admissions-resources__links-item">
                              	<a href="/pdfs/admissions/financial-aid/2023EADASurvey.pdf" target="_self" rel="noopener" class="cta--primary">Academic Year 2023</a>
                              </div>
                           <div class="admissions-resources__links-item">
                              	<a href="/pdfs/admissions/financial-aid/2022EADASurvey.pdf" target="_self" rel="noopener" class="cta--primary">Academic Year 2022</a>
                              </div>
                           
                           				</div>
                        			</div>
                     			
                     		</div>
